          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In the heart of Egypt’s enchanting Dakhla Oasis, a culinary adventure awaits, offering an authentic taste of the region’s rich flavors and traditional dishes. Here’s a guide to some of the oasis’s most delightful dining experiences:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Forsan Cafe"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Tucked away in Sharia Al Wadi, just behind the El Forsan Hotel, this charming cafe is a local favorite. It’s a perfect spot to unwind after a day of exploring, where you can indulge in a selection of refreshments and light bites in a cozy and inviting atmosphere."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Said Shihad"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A culinary gem located on Sharia Al Thawra Al Khadra, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Said Shihad"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is renowned for its expertly grilled meats. The shish kebab here is nothing short of perfection, traditionally served with a tantalizing side of potatoes in a rich tomato sauce, accompanied by rice and beans. It’s a lunchtime haven for those seeking to experience the authentic flavors of the oasis."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ahmed Hamdy’s Restaurant"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Also situated on Sharia Al Thawra Al Khadra, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Ahmed Hamdy’s Restaurant"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is a celebration of Egyptian cuisine. Offering a diverse menu of delicious dishes, both indoor and outdoor seating, this restaurant caters to a variety of tastes. To complement your meal, fresh juices are available, and for those looking to relax, a selection of shisha flavors is on offer."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Fateer Al Wadi"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000019",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For those with a sweet tooth or in search of a light snack, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Fateer Al Wadi"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is a must-visit. Located on Sharia Al Thawra Al Khadra, this bakery specializes in fresh pastries, straight from the oven. The aroma of freshly baked goods and the warm, welcoming ambiance make it an irresistible stop."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
