        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "These cafes, located in Mut, are perfect for a casual dining experience. They offer traditional Egyptian snacks and beverages, providing a glimpse into the daily life of the oasis’s residents."
